{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23768","headline":"送东都留守令狐尚书赴任 · 白居易","name":"送东都留守令狐尚书赴任","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翠华黄屋未东巡，碧洛青嵩付大臣。\n地称高情多水竹，山宜闲望少风尘。\n龙门即拟爲游客，金谷先凭作主人。\n歌酒家家花处处，莫空管领上阳春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23768.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23768","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}